   establishing traceability chain, proficiency testing scheme and
   validation)of the passive samplers. Thus, a feasibility study for
   producing and certifying reference materials (CRM) for sulphur dioxide
   (SO2) and nitrogen dioxide (NO2) diffusive samplers has been carried
   out. The results of a pilot proficiency testing using the prepared NO2
   CRMs are presented. In addition, the JRC has also)organized an
   inter-comparison exercise for commercially available NO2/ozone (O-3)
   diffusive samplers, which consisted of both laboratory and field tests.
   Diffusive samplers have also been used in different monitoring
