   type of rules, which is possible to solve and describe the system
   composition. The results of this system consist from calculations and
   drawing suitable for CAD systems. The outputs are not only
   hydrotechnical computations but also the drawings of longitudinal
   profiles of designed sewer pipes or evaluated sewer profiles. These
