Organization = {Int Soc Digital Health \& Educat; Romanian Soc Med Bioengn; Inst Comp
   Sci Romanian Acad},
Abstract = {An observational study has been conducted to evaluate the stress level
   at the level of public and private research, development and innovation
   institutes (RDII) in Romania during COVID-19 pandemic. A questionnaire
   has been developed and the RDIIs in Romania were invited to fill as per
   15 November to 15 December 2021. The RDII respondents boast
   well-established infrastructures equipped with major scientific
   resources, primarily funded through nonreimbursable public funds, a
   significant portion of which originates from the EU. Stress is a
   prevalent concern among respondents, with a significant portion
   perceiving it as a bodily pressure and reporting feeling affected by it.
   Many respondents indicated a high volume of tasks, an inadequate working
   atmosphere, routine responsibilities, underestimated task durations, and
   the need for multitasking as stress factors.},
