   11-14, 2010},
Organization = {Cognit Sci Soc; Air Force Off Sci Res; Natl Sci Fdn; Air Force Res Lab;
   Off Naval Res; Inst Educ Sci; Robert J Glushko \& Pamela Samuelson Fdn},
Abstract = {We present a system designed to model characteristics which contribute
   to the emotional content of music. It creates n-gram models, Hidden
   Markov Models, and entropy-based models from corpora of musical
   selections representing various emotions. These models can be used both
   to identify emotional content and generate pieces representative of a
   target emotion. According to survey results, generated selections were
   able to communicate a desired emotion as effectively as human-generated
   compositions.},
