Abstract = {In today's competitive business environment, corporations can no longer
   afford to waste the potential of their workforce. There are important
   factors in the employee's workplace that influence significantly on
   their level of motivation and performance. The main objective of the
   study is to understand the relationship between the employees'
   performance and their physical work environment. The private sector
   corporations of Egypt have been chosen as the population for the study.
