Abstract = {We must admit that the conflictual states are a reality within the
   school organizations and if we continue to ignore them they will not
   vanish, at most they will perpetuate in time. In trying to improve the
   organizational context of the school, it is necessary to develop an
   interdisciplinary approach for the resolution of conflicts. The school
   must enter into an organizational self-learning process to eliminate the
