   performance, the term thermalscape is proposed. In the evaluation of
   green building and ecological city area, outdoor thermal environment is
   one of the more important items but lack of a unified index. The
   universal thermal climate index (UTCI) is studied and proposed jointly
   by international organizations, has received more and more attention in
   recent years. Honeybee, the architecture performance analysis plug-in of
