Abstract = {In order to build a user-friendly and urban intelligent public
   transportation service system, this paper, treating the analysis of
   public transportation system of Beijing as a breakthrough point,
   provides a perfect service design of public transportation and the
   optimization of travel route basing on the user's habits, scheduling and
   health conditions. All the travel data of traffic system and users' data
   such as health indicators are obtained from cloud platform. The
   development and application prospect of intelligent public
   transportation embodies the user-centered design concept. This paper
   preliminary develops a user-friendly and efficient design system of
   urban public transportation services with the trait of intelligence.},
