   Environm Technol SA},
Abstract = {In order to the investigate the vertical aerosol gradient impact by the
   wind flow within an urban street canyon, a two-dimensional air quality
   numerical model based on the atmospheric convection-diffusion equations
   and the k-e turbulent model was used. The aerosol and trace element
   experiment data, which was carried out by our monitoring program in an
   urban street canyon of Patras (1999), was selected to validate the
   numerical model. The good approximation between the calculated and
   observed make it possible to use the numerical model simulation to
   explain the pollutant distributions (e.g. Na,Fe,K,Zn) emitted by source
   out from the urban street canyon.},
