   Protection (EDEP), Beijing, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUN 11-12, 2016},
Abstract = {This research analyzed the distribution characteristics of land use in
   different slope aspect in class level and landscape level which was
   started from analyze slope aspect characteristics use DEM, was a case of
   Yuanjiang Hani, Yi and Dai autonomous county in Yunnan. This study
   extracted intermontane basin of plateau mountain area from whole county
   to research solely, contraposed the particularity of the city
   environment in plateau mountain area. This way broke through the
   landscape research in city or natural environment, and can avoid the
   impact on city landscape from natural environment on data aspect which
   impact was very obvious in plateau's mountainous area and it would
   interference the research of city landscape gravely. This research
   discovered that urban development was behindhand, the utilization of
   water was difficult, the economic source was agriculture as the
   principal, people's life was simple but ecological damage rate was low.
   This paper processed data use FRAGSTATS, ArcGIS and Excel firstly, then
   analyzed the choise in landscape pattern index and data error deeply.
   Finally, explained the difference of landscape in intermontane basin
   based on different slope aspect and the relationship with urban
   development and utilization. This paper explained briefly for the
   actuality of city development in Yuanjiang county. In comparison with
   general city landscape pattern and the city landscape pattern of
   intermontane basin to explain the particularity of city landscape
   pattern of plateau's mountainous area and proposed suggestions for city
   planning and ecological protection in intermontane basin.},
