   Calibrations of the Water Surface for Characterization of Water Waves -
   a Space-time Imaging Approach},
Booktitle = {REMOTE SENSING OF THE OCEAN, SEA ICE, COASTAL WATERS, AND LARGE WATER
   REGIONS 2021},
