   office buildings were selected and the investigations on urban large
   commercial office buildings of 2007 whole-yearly energy consumption were
   carried through in Changsha of Hunan province. Conclusions are made as
   follows: The large commercial 2 office building energy consumption per
   unit area in an average of 117.76 kWh/(m(2).yr); including the energy
   consumption of 58.31kWh/(m(2).yr) in air-conditioning system.
   Air-conditioning is the impact of high and low energy consumption of
   office buildings of the main factors. Under the problems found in the
   investigation process and the energy consumption analysis of status quo
