Abstract = {The paper applies the economics theory and introduces practice example
   to reveal the affection of system innovation science and technology
   advancement to administrative regional economy so as to think these to
   be most important factors for the affection. The main opinion is
   referred to as follows: (1) Completed economic system for the market,
   changed governmental function to be the premise for administrative
   regional economic development; (2) The movable economic resource is the
   main factor for administrative regional economic development. It shows
   in the way for the accept ability. The strong or weak for the movable
   economic acceptation ability depended on the strong or weak ability of
   the self-organization of economic system and administrative regional
   governmental management economy so as to be the key for improvement of
   the ability of self-organization based on the promotion of governmental
   management innovation; (3) The system factor also is the factor of
   decisive function to administrative regional governmental management
   economy; (4) Science and technology is the most active factor in the
   factors of production. Science and technology promotes the development
   of social productivity directly. The innovation for science and
   technology is the key to expedite the development of administrative
   regional governmental management economy. If the administrative regional
   governmental management economy is developed in normal, it must rely on
   the advancement and innovation of science and technology, set up new
   innovation system for administrative regional to upgrade new regional
   innovation ability. Therefore, certain new key points are set forth for
   system innovation and science and technology innovation.},
